('270', '71', '<p style=\'margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(23, 43, 77); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, \"Fira Sans\", \"Droid Sans\", \"Helvetica Neue\", sans-serif; font-size: 14px; outline: none !important;\'>Tagging Support comment:</p><p style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: none !important;\"><font color=\"#172b4d\" face=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Fira Sans, Droid Sans, Helvetica Neue, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">We\'ll extend the request for 2 month for this time.</span></font></p><p style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: none !important;\"><font color=\"#172b4d\" face=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Fira Sans, Droid Sans, Helvetica Neue, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Kindly proceed with Heejin Choi to complete approval process.</span></font></p><p style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; outline: none !important;\"><font color=\"#172b4d\" face=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Fira Sans, Droid Sans, Helvetica Neue, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">The Unpack event this July is coming close, please ensure the approval is available in order not to affect the tracking.</span></font></p>', '1', '1', '2026-06-19 08:50:00', '2026-06-19 08:50:00'),
