('594', '91', '<p>Timeline:</p><ul><li>[SESAR] New Rule Published - May 26 <a href=\"https://jira.secext.samsung.net/browse/GTA-36536\" target=\"_blank\">https://jira.secext.samsung.net/browse/GTA-36536</a> </li><li>HOLIDAY BREAK - May 25-29</li><li>[SESAR] Sent an email asking for data collection verification to CSQ team - June 2 (Tuesday) [<b>RE:(9) Samsung x CSQ Implementation Thread</b>]</li><li>[SESAR] Ahmed replied - found issues asking to fix - June 5 (Friday) [<b>Re: (9) Samsung x CSQ Implementation &amp; Tracker Updates [GTA-36489] [GTA-36536]</b>]</li><li>[SESAR] We replied after investigating the issues raised - June 8 (Monday) [<b>Re: (10) Samsung x CSQ Implementation &amp; Tracker Updates [GTA-36489] [GTA-36536]</b>]</li><li>[SESAR] Ahmed replied on the same day with questions - June 8 (Monday) </li><li>[SESAR] We replied to answer the queries sent by Ahmed and to ask for the approach they want to proceed with - June 9 (Tuesday) [<b>Re: (11) Samsung x CSQ Implementation &amp; Tracker Updates [GTA-36489] [GTA-36536]</b>]</li><li>[SESAR] We sent a follow up email after not receiving a response - June 16 (Tuesday) [<b>Re: (12) Samsung x CSQ Implementation &amp; Tracker Updates [GTA-36489] [GTA-36536]</b>]</li><li>[SESAR] They sent a response after the follow up to confirm which approach to proceed - June 16 (Tuesday)</li><li>[SESAR] We sent an email saying the approach is now published and asked for verification - June 18 (Thursday)</li><li>[SESAR] Ahmed sent a reply saying the custom variable still has bad data and needs to be fixed - June 24 (Wednesday) [<b>Re: (13) Samsung x CSQ Implementation &amp; Tracker Updates [GTA-36489] [GTA-36536]</b>]</li><li>[SESAR] We sent a reply saying the issue has been fixed and asked for re-verification - June 26 (Friday) [<b>Re: (14) Samsung x CSQ Implementation &amp; Tracker Updates [GTA-36489] [GTA-36536]</b>]</li></ul>', '1', '1', '2026-07-08 08:56:32', '2026-07-08 08:56:32'),
