LV IQ_AR (Iraq)\\n- SELV IQ_KU (Kurdistan)\\n- SELV LEVANT (Levant)\\n\\n**Critical Data Issues**\\nThese aren\'t just routine updates. The violations involve:\\n- **Meta Pixel:** Add to Cart triggers are incorrectly set to \\\"window loaded\\\" instead of \\\"click\\\" - this means the tag may fire before the user actually adds to cart, inflating metrics.\\n- **GoogleAds:** Incorrect syntax (`googleads` vs `google_ads`, `pixel_id` vs `account_id`) that could cause **data loss** in conversion tracking.\\n\\n**Why It Needs Visibility**\\n- **Requested by:** CNX (Compliance\\/Governance team)\\n- **Priority:** 10 (Highest)\\n- **Impact:** Affects data accuracy for paid media optimization across 6+ markets\\n- **Status:** Still open after 2+ weeks (requested May 28, started June 16)\\n\\nThis batch represents a compliance risk that affects data integrity for multiple subsidiaries and should be prioritized before the incorrect data impacts campaign optimization decisions.\"}]', '2026-08-07 09:37:40', '2026-08-07 09:40:14'),
