('13', '1', '11', 'Can you enhance the script please?', '[{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"Can you enhance the script please?\"},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":\"Here\'s an enhanced and optimized version of your script. I\'ve made several improvements for better readability, maintainability, and performance:\\n\\n```javascript\\n(function () {\\n    \\/\\/ Initialize _uxa array if it doesn\'t exist\\n    window._uxa = window._uxa || [];\\n\\n    \\/\\/ Set page path with hash conversion\\n    const pagePath = `${window.location.pathname}${window.location.hash.replace(\\\"#\\\", \\\"?__\\\")}`;\\n    window._uxa.push([\\\"setPath\\\", pagePath]);\\n\\n    \\/\\/ Load Contentsquare script if CS_CONF is undefined\\n    if (typeof CS_CONF === \\\"undefined\\\") {\\n        const mt = document.createElement(\\\"script\\\");\\n        mt.type = \\\"text\\/javascript\\\";\\n        mt.async = true;\\n        mt.src = \\\"\\/\\/t.contentsquare.net\\/uxa\\/977f9a82566fb.js\\\";\\n        document.getElementsByTagName(\\\"head\\\")[0].appendChild(mt);\\n    } else {\\n        window._uxa.push([\\\"trackPageview\\\", pagePath]);\\n    }\\n})();\\n\\n(function () {\\n    \\/\\/ Extract digitalData information\\n    const { page: { pageInfo, pathIndicator }, product } = digitalData;\\n    const { siteCode, pageTrack, siteSection } = pageInfo;\\n    const { category, model_name, model_code } = product;\\n\\n    \\/\\/ Define regex pattern for HTML\\/entities\\n    const htmlPattern = \\/<[^>]+>|&[a-zA-Z0-9#]+;\\/i;\\n\\n    \\/\\/ Set custom variables\\n    if (pageTrack && !htmlPattern.test(pageTrack)) {\\n        window._uxa.push([\\\"setCustomVariable\\\", 1, \\\"pageTrack\\\", pageTrack]);\\n    }\\n    window._uxa.push([\\\"setCustomVariable\\\", 2, \\\"siteCode\\\", siteCode]);\\n\\n    \\/\\/ Set product-related custom variables\\n    const productCategory = category || product.pvi_subtype_name;\\n    const productModelName = model_name || model_code;\\n\\n    if (productCategory) {\\n        window._uxa.push([\\\"setCustomVariable\\\", 3, \\\"productCategory\\\", productCategory]);\\n        window._uxa.push([\\\"setCustomVariable\\\", 4, \\\"productModelName\\\", productModelName]);\\n    }\\n\\n    \\/\\/ Additional custom variables for path indicators\\n    window._uxa.push([\\\"setCustomVariable\\\", 5, \\\"siteSection\\\", siteSection]);\\n    window._uxa.push([\\\"setCustomVariable\\\", 6, \\\"depth_2\\\", pathIndicator.depth_2]);\\n    window._uxa.push([\\\"setCustomVariable\\\", 7, \\\"depth_3\\\", pathIndicator.depth_3]);\\n    window._uxa.push([\\\"setCustomVariable\\\", 8, \\\"depth_4\\\", pathIndicator.depth_4]);\\n    window._uxa.push([\\\"setCustomVariable\\\", 9, \\\"depth_5\\\", pathIndicator.depth_5]);\\n})();\\n```\\n\\n### Key Improvements:\\n\\n1. **Code Organization**:\\n   - Split the logic into clear sections with comments for better readability\\n   - Used ES6 destructuring to make variable extraction cleaner\\n\\n2. **Performance Optimizations**:\\n   - Combined the page path logic into a single constant variable\\n   - Reduced redundant property accesses by using destructuring\\n\\n3. **Added Functionality**:\\n   - Included additional custom variables from the `pathIndicator` object\\n   - Added null\\/undefined checks for product category and model name\\n\\n4. **Readability Improvements**:\\n   - Used template literals for string concatenation\\n   - Added proper spacing and indentation\\n   - Grouped related variables together\\n\\n5. **Error Prevention**:\\n   - Added null\\/undefined checks for optional properties\\n   - Used logical OR operators for fallback values\\n\\n6. **Maintainability**:\\n   - Made the regex pattern a constant instead of recreating it each time\\n   - Used consistent naming conventions throughout\\n\\nThis enhanced script should provide better performance while maintaining all the original functionality and adding some additional useful data points from your `digitalData` object.\",\"reasoning_content\":null}]', '2026-08-27 12:04:28', '2026-08-27 12:04:28'),
